---
import CategoryArchive from '../../components/CategoryArchive.astro';

const articleGroups = [
  {
    label: 'Routines and Schedules',
    subcategories: ['routines', 'draining', 'water-testing'],
  },
  {
    label: 'Filters',
    subcategories: ['filters'],
  },
  {
    label: 'Cover and Shell Care',
    subcategories: ['covers', 'shell'],
  },
];
---

<CategoryArchive category="maintenance" articleGroups={articleGroups}>
  <p>
    A short, consistent routine prevents most water and equipment surprises. TubWise
    maintenance guides focus on what to do weekly, monthly, and a few times a year,
    without overcomplicating ownership. Match every interval to your owner's manual,
    and treat public-health sanitizer checks separately from brand maintenance calendars.
  </p>

  <p>
    For cover fit and construction choices when a replacement is needed, see
    <a href="/buying-guides/how-to-choose-a-hot-tub-cover">How to Choose a Hot Tub Cover</a>.
  </p>
</CategoryArchive>
